<title>HUNGARY: BUDAPEST BOURSE TURNOVER FALLS TO HUF 6.912 BLN.</title>
<headline>BUDAPEST BOURSE TURNOVER FALLS TO HUF 6.912 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange's spot share turnover fell to 6.912 billion forints on Monday from 8.444 billion forints on Friday, according to final figures.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsrogm +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
